  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Civic Action for Reform of Economic Systems - ICARES Zimbabwe ZCC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aimed at enhancing participation of right holders, faith actors and CSOs for improved transparency and accountability on economic governance. It seeks to empower the people to advocate for guaranteed access to social services for the marginalized groups in order to eradicate poverty and achieve economic and gender justice.&#xa0; The project also seeks to promote FBOs led advocacy for inclusive, green and just societies.&#xa0; The Civil Society and Faith Actors are to participate more meaningfully in the debate on global economic architecture reform . ZCC&#xa0; will work with CSO,CBO, inter-faith actors and governmental stakeholders to participate in ongoing debates on global economic architecture reform. This project will be implemented in Harare, Bulawayo, Bubi, Lupane, Zvishavane and Gokwe South.</narrative>
  </description>
